  "description": "Audit log & content log viewer for the Umbraco backoffice (Umbraco 17 and 18). Browse, search, filter, sort and export the umbracoAudit and umbracoLog tables from Settings - no SQL needed. Features a unified Timeline, Content Logs and Audit Trail, full-text search, user/date filters, quick date ranges, sortable columns, quick edit links, GMT/UTC toggle, CSV export and shareable URL filters. Read-only, works on SQL Server, SQLite and PostgreSQL. Great for content auditing, user activity tracking, security review and compliance/GDPR reporting.",
